==Battleground==
*1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.
*2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gardeneel Bros.]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Axoloty]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal One Horn]] spawns.
**1 [[Sir Metal Seal]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Spam meatshields, [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress/Soba Cat]], and [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] until all the Metal enemies die. [[Miracle Performance (Combo)|Miracle Performance]] can help speed things up.  After that, send in [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and enjoy your victory.

Alternatively, you can stall the Metals and get Gardeneel to warp your A. Bahamut to the base. This stage is pitifully easy, especially considering the presence of Sir Metal Seal.

==Trivia==
*In Greek mythology, Triton is the son of [[Wrathful Poseidon (Uber Rare Cat)|Poseidon]] and Amphitrite.

